1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,695
For years,
he served the emperor

2
00:00:02,695 --> 00:00:04,775
in his palace
in Addis Ababa.

3
00:00:04,775 --> 00:00:07,500
They called him the
honey wine server.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:14,130
He knew how to pour without
spilling a single drop.

5
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:20,214
And he knew how to disappear
quietly into the room.

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,842
One night,
at a formal gathering,

7
00:00:25,842 --> 00:00:28,971
guests filled
the long tables.

8
00:00:29,983 --> 00:00:34,161
A guest asked whether the
emperor even knew his name.

9
00:00:35,983 --> 00:00:39,275
He lowered his eyes in
silence, and said nothing.

10
00:00:42,983 --> 00:00:45,020
The great emperor
set down his

11
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,990
glass and asked
for his name.

12
00:00:49,983 --> 00:00:53,630
Hearing Tesfaye,
he raised a toast,

13
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:57,799
and the whole hall
lifted their glasses.

14
00:00:58,817 --> 00:01:01,806
My grandmother said he spent

15
00:01:01,806 --> 00:01:04,902
his life serving
the emperor.

16
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:08,645
But that night,
for one moment,

17
00:01:08,645 --> 00:01:13,072
the whole room remembered
the man behind the tray.

